where $\phi$ is an arbitrary function.

\Rightarrow \quad \frac{y}{x} \frac{d y}{d x}=\frac{y^2}{x^2}+\frac{\phi\left(\frac{y}{x}\right)^2}{\phi^{\prime}\left(\frac{y}{x}\right)^2}

Let $y=v x$, where $v$ is function of $x$.

\Rightarrow \quad \frac{d y}{d x}=v+x \frac{d v}{d x}

$\begin{array}{ll}\text { so } & v\left(v+x \frac{d v}{d x}\right)=v^2+\frac{\phi\left(v^2\right)}{\phi^{\prime}\left(v^2\right)} \\ \Rightarrow & v x \frac{d v}{d x}=\frac{\phi\left(v^2\right)}{\phi^{\prime}\left(v^2\right)} \\ \Rightarrow & \int v \frac{\phi^{\prime}\left(v^2\right)}{\phi\left(v^2\right)} d v=\int \frac{d x}{x}\end{array}$
\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow \quad \frac{1}{2} \log _e \phi\left(v^2\right)=\log _e x+\log _e(\sqrt{c})=\log _e(\sqrt{c} x) \\
